    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35674" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pĕr-ungo</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">-unguo</span></b> , unxi, unctum, 3, v.
